  ('roe', 3, 'caviar from roe', 'Caviar, made from roe, is considered a luxurious food item worldwide.', '鱼子酱是用鱼卵制成的，全球被视为奢华食品。', 'work'),
  ('acrimonious', 1, 'acrimonious debate', 'The acrimonious debate over the policy changes drew sharp responses from both sides.', '关于政策变更的激烈辩论引发了双方的激烈反应。', 'academic'),
  ('acrimonious', 2, 'acrimonious relationship', 'Their acrimonious relationship became the talk of the neighborhood after the incident.', '事件发生后，他们尖刻的关系成为邻里的谈资。', 'daily_life'),
  ('acrimonious', 3, 'acrimonious exchange', 'An acrimonious exchange between the politicians highlighted the divisions within the party.', '政治家之间的激烈交锋突显了党内的分歧。', 'news'),
  ('recluse', 1, 'recluse lifestyle', 'Many people choose a recluse lifestyle to escape the pressures of modern life.', '许多人选择隐居的生活方式以逃避现代生活的压力。', 'daily_life'),
  ('recluse', 2, 'social recluse', 'The artist became a social recluse after gaining fame, avoiding public events and gatherings.', '这位艺术家在成名后变成了社交隐士，避免参加公众活动和聚会。', 'culture'),
  ('recluse', 3, 'recluse from society', 'Increasingly, some individuals decide to recluse from society to find peace and solitude.', '越来越多的人决定隐居于社会，以寻找内心的宁静和孤独。', 'news'),
  ('flabby', 1, 'flabby muscles', 'Many individuals struggle with flabby muscles as a result of inactivity.', '许多人因为缺乏活动而面临肌肉松弛的问题。', 'health'),
  ('flabby', 2, 'flabby economy', 'Experts warned that a flabby economy may hinder recovery efforts in the region.', '专家警告说，疲软的经济可能会阻碍该地区的复苏努力。', 'news'),
  ('flabby', 3, 'flabby arguments', 'The professor criticized the paper for its flabby arguments that lacked rigor.', '教授批评这篇论文的论点松弛，缺乏严谨性。', 'academic'),
  ('lethargy', 1, 'chronic lethargy', 'Chronic lethargy can be a symptom of various underlying health issues.', '慢性无精打采可能是各种潜在健康问题的症状。', 'health'),
  ('lethargy', 2, 'mental lethargy', 'Many students experience mental lethargy during exam periods due to stress and fatigue.', '许多学生在考试期间因压力和疲惫而感到精神无精打采。', 'academic'),
  ('lethargy', 3, 'lethargy in the workplace', 'Lethargy in the workplace can lead to decreased productivity and employee dissatisfaction.', '工作场所的无精打采可能导致生产力下降和员工不满。', 'work'),
  ('aerodynamics', 1, 'aerodynamics expert', 'Experts in aerodynamics often contribute to advancements in aircraft design.', '空气动力学专家常常为飞机设计的进步做出贡献。', 'academic'),
  ('aerodynamics', 2, 'aerodynamics principles', 'Understanding the principles of aerodynamics is crucial for engineers creating efficient vehicles.', '理解空气动力学原理对于设计高效交通工具的工程师至关重要。', 'science_tech'),
  ('aerodynamics', 3, 'aerodynamics research', 'Recent research on aerodynamics has revealed new insights into efficient flight paths.', '最近关于空气动力学的研究揭示了高效飞行路径的新见解。', 'news'),
  ('videocassette', 1, 'watch a videocassette', 'Many families used to watch a videocassette on Friday nights together.', '许多家庭过去习惯于在星期五晚上一起观看录像带。', 'daily_life'),
  ('videocassette', 2, 'buy a videocassette', 'In the 1980s, people often rushed to buy a videocassette of the latest movie release.', '在八十年代，人们常常急于购买最新电影发行的录像带。', 'culture'),
  ('videocassette', 3, 'rent a videocassette', 'Students could rent a videocassette for educational purposes from the local library.', '学生可以从当地图书馆租借录像带用于学习。', 'education'),
  ('transcontinental', 1, 'transcontinental railroad', 'The construction of the transcontinental railroad revolutionized transportation in the United States.', '跨洲铁路的建设彻底改变了美国的运输方式。', 'travel'),
  ('transcontinental', 2, 'transcontinental flights', 'Many travelers prefer transcontinental flights for their convenience and speed.', '许多旅客更喜欢跨洲航班，因为它们方便且快捷。', 'daily_life'),
  ('transcontinental', 3, 'transcontinental connections', 'Establishing transcontinental connections is crucial for global business operations today.', '建立跨洲联系对于当今全球业务运营至关重要。', 'work'),
  ('bigoted', 1, 'bigoted beliefs', 'Students should challenge bigoted beliefs that undermine equality in society.', '学生们应当挑战削弱社会平等的偏执信念。', 'education'),
  ('bigoted', 2, 'bigoted views', 'The article highlighted the dangers of spreading bigoted views in public discourse.', '这篇文章强调了在公共话语中传播偏执观点的危险性。', 'news'),
  ('bigoted', 3, 'bigoted attitudes', 'Many people strive to overcome bigoted attitudes inherited from previous generations.', '许多人努力克服从前几代人继承的偏执态度。', 'daily_life'),
  ('dejected', 1, 'dejected players', 'After losing the championship, the players looked dejected as they left the field.', '在失去冠军后，球员们走离球场时显得沮丧。', 'daily_life'),
  ('dejected', 2, 'dejected look', 'Witnesses reported seeing a dejected look on her face after the disappointing announcement.', '目击者报告称，在失望的公告后，她的脸上显露出沮丧的神情。', 'news'),
  ('dejected', 3, 'dejected mood', 'His dejected mood was evident during the team meeting after the project''s failure.', '在项目失败后的团队会议上，他沮丧的情绪显而易见。', 'work'),
  ('tedium', 1, 'academic tedium', 'Students often experience academic tedium during lengthy lectures that lack engagement.', '学生们经常在缺乏互动的冗长讲座中感到学术上的单调乏味。', 'academic'),
  ('tedium', 2, 'daily life tedium', 'Many adults find daily life tedium can lead to feelings of frustration and boredom.', '许多成年人发现日常生活的单调乏味会导致挫败感和无聊。', 'daily_life'),
  ('tedium', 3, 'work-related tedium', 'Employees reported that work-related tedium decreases overall job satisfaction and productivity.', '员工们报告说，工作相关的单调乏味降低了整体工作满意度和生产力。', 'work'),
  ('packer', 1, 'food packers', 'Food packers ensure that all items are properly sealed before shipment.', '食品包装工确保所有物品在发货前都得到妥善密封。', 'work'),
  ('packer', 2, 'shipping packers', 'Shipping packers work diligently to meet tight deadlines every day.', '发货包装工每天都在努力工作以满足紧迫的截止日期。', 'daily_life'),
  ('packer', 3, 'moving packers', 'Many moving packers provide services to help families relocate smoothly.', '许多搬家包装工提供服务，以帮助家庭顺利搬迁。', 'travel'),
  ('overcharge', 1, 'overcharge customers', 'Customers reported that the store tends to overcharge them regularly.', '顾客反映，这家店经常对他们过高收费。', 'work'),
  ('overcharge', 2, 'overcharge for services', 'The company was accused of attempting to overcharge for its services during the crisis.', '该公司被指控在危机期间试图对其服务过高收费。', 'news'),
  ('overcharge', 3, 'overcharge fees', 'Students often complain when universities impose high overcharge fees without clear justification.', '学生们常抱怨大学对他们征收没有明确理由的高额过高收费。', 'education'),
  ('urbane', 1, 'urbane lifestyle', 'An urbane lifestyle often reflects a deep appreciation for the arts and fine dining.', '文雅的生活方式往往体现了对艺术和美食的深刻欣赏。', 'culture'),
  ('urbane', 2, 'urbane demeanor', 'Her urbane demeanor made a lasting impression on everyone at the conference.', '她文雅的举止给会议上的每个人留下了深刻的印象。', 'daily_life'),
  ('urbane', 3, 'urbane conversation', 'Engaging in urbane conversation can enhance professional networking opportunities significantly.', '参与文雅的对话可以显著提升职业网络机会。', 'work'),
  ('ruinous', 1, 'ruinous consequences', 'Many experts warned of the ruinous consequences of unchecked climate change.', '许多专家警告说，气候变化失控将导致破坏性的后果。', 'news'),
  ('ruinous', 2, 'ruinous debt', 'The company found itself burdened with ruinous debt after the market collapse.', '在市场崩溃后，公司发现自己背负着破坏性的债务。', 'work'),
