  ('lubrication', 1, 'oil lubrication', 'Effective oil lubrication is crucial for machinery to function smoothly.', '有效的油润滑对机器顺利运作至关重要。', 'work'),
  ('lubrication', 2, 'lubrication system', 'An advanced lubrication system can enhance the lifespan of mechanical components.', '先进的润滑系统可以延长机械部件的使用寿命。', 'science_tech'),
  ('lubrication', 3, 'preventive lubrication', 'Preventive lubrication helps reduce wear and tear in various equipment.', '预防性润滑有助于减少各种设备的磨损。', 'health'),
