  ('teem', 1, 'teem with life', 'Oceans teem with life, hosting a diverse range of species in their depths.', '海洋充满生机，深处栖息着多样的物种。', 'environment'),
  ('teem', 2, 'teem with visitors', 'During the summer months, tourist destinations teem with visitors eager to explore.', '在夏季，旅游胜地充满了渴望探索的游客。', 'travel'),
  ('teem', 3, 'teeming with ideas', 'The brainstorming session was teeming with ideas that could transform the project.', '头脑风暴会议充满了可以改变项目的创意。', 'work'),
