  ('singe', 2, 'singe the edges', 'The designer decided to singe the edges of the fabric for a more unique look.', '设计师决定烧焦布料的边缘，以获得更独特的外观。', 'work'),
  ('singe', 3, 'singe the skin', 'Excessive heat from the stove can singe the skin, causing painful burns.', '炉子的过高温度可能烧焦皮肤，造成疼痛的烧伤。', 'health'),
